  "thag1.109:0.4": "1. 11. 9. ",
  "thag1.109:1.1": "na nūnāyaṃ paramahitānukampino ",
  "thag1.109:1.2": "rahogato anuvigaṇeti sāsanaṃ, ",
  "thag1.109:1.3": "tathāhayaṃ viharati pākatindriyo ",
  "thag1.109:1.4": "migī yathā taruṇajātikā vane’ti. itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ",
  "thag1.109:1.5": "saṅgharakkhito thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. saṅgharakkhitattheragāthā. "
}
